WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.770
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

2
00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.070
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

3
00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.370
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:08.610
And we're best friends.
我们还是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:12.430
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.
现在，我们专门为你制作了这档《办公室》终极重温播客。

6
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:19.410
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会剖析一集《办公室》，并分享只有身临其境的我们才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

7
00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:20.570
We're The Office ladies.
我们是《办公室》女士。

8
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.370
I love it.
我太喜欢了。

9
00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:24.790
Creed is here.
克里德来了。

10
00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:25.630
Creed is here.
克里德来了。

11
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:26.510
Creed is here.
克里德来了。

12
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:27.970
Creed is in the house.
克里德大驾光临了。

13
00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:28.350
Yeah.
没错。

14
00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.350
This is so amazing.
这太棒了。

15
00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:34.030
Creed's going to be with us for the whole episode, guys.
伙计们，克里德这整集都会和我们在一起。

16
00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:38.610
Okay, Creed, you are our first in-house visitor, right?
好的，克里德，你是我们第一位到场的嘉宾，对吧？

17
00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.550
I mean, we've had people call in, but you're our first in-house gueSt.
我是说，我们之前有连线过嘉宾，但你是第一位亲临现场的。

18
00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:42.730
I'm the first one.
我是第一个。

19
00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:45.150
I might have a bathroom break or something.
我可能得去趟洗手间什么的。

20
00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:46.950
I won't be for the whole thing, but I'll be in and out.
我不会全程都在，但我会进进出出的。

21
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.210
We can provide you with a bathroom break.
我们可以为你安排洗手间休息时间。

22
00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:48.260
Okay, good.
好的，太好了。

23
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:48.750
That'd be good.
那很好。

24
00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:49.110
That'd be good.
那很好。

25
00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:50.010
We can take a bathroom break.
我们可以休息一下去洗手间。

26
00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:50.610
I'm old school.
我是老派作风。

27
00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.670
Well, I'm old, so that's part of it, you know.
嗯，我年纪大了，所以这也是原因之一，你知道的。

28
00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:57.650
I need everybody to know that I've already teared up twice since Creed has been here.
我得让大家知道，克里德来这里之后，我已经感动落泪两次了。

29
00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:58.070
Oh.
噢。

30
00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:02.690
You've said two touching – well, first of all, just seeing you almost burst into tears.
你说了两件感人的事——首先，光是看到你，我就差点热泪盈眶了。

31
00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:06.070
But then you've said, like, five amazing things that have touched my heart already.
而且你刚才说的五件了不起的事，已经触动了我的心弦。

32
00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:09.110
Well, as soon as I get together with you, it's just back – we're back on the set,
嗯，只要一和你聚在一起，那种感觉就回来了——我们就像回到了片场，

33
00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:12.330
you know, and it's all like, oh, I miss you girls.
你知道的，那种感觉就是，噢，我好想念你们这些女孩。

34
00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:15.270
Creed lives down the street from me.
克里德就住在我家那条街上。

35
00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:15.460
Yes.
是的。

36
00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:17.490
